     1785     on error undo, return error return-value
     1786     :
     1787           if (valid-handle(g#attr-lib) <> true) then do:   run gbl/attr-lib.p persistent no-error .   if error-status :error or (valid-handle(g#attr-lib) <> true) then do:     message       "Error starting attr-lib.p" skip       g#attr-lib skip       g#attr-lib :type skip       g#attr-lib :file-name skip       error-status :get-message(1) skip       return-value skip       view-as alert-box error .     stop .   end. end. run gds-attr_check-can-set-dt-seasons in g#attr-lib
     1788         (input  p-gds-code
     1789         ,output p-can-set
     1790         ) no-error .
     1791       if error-status :error
     1792       then do:
     1793         undo, return error return-value .
